{"id":"n16298-1-10","stage":4,"title":"나들이 · 串门","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16298-1-10-1","ko":"혼자 오신 걸 보니 부인이 어디 가셨나 봐요?","zh":"看您是独自来的，应该是您的妻子去哪儿了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自地，单独地","explanation":"혼자：独自地，单独地","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30208","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오신","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부인이","meaning":"夫人，令夫人","explanation":"부인：夫人，令夫人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부인","audio":"/audio/650b717aa58672b96c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62505","senseId":"1","lemma":"부인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가셨나","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自地，单独地","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30208","definition":"没有其他人地。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来；看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"650b717aa58672b9","term":"부인","zh":"夫人，令夫人","audio":"/audio/650b717aa58672b96c1d.mp3","entryId":"62505","definition":"(敬语)别人的妻子。","pronunciation":["부인"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1059f53dbc2a23323523.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16298-1-10-2","ko":"네, 아내는 친정 나들이를 갔어요.","zh":"是的，我妻子去娘家玩了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"你","explanation":"네：你","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89180","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아내는","meaning":"妻子，爱人，老婆","explanation":"아내：妻子，爱人，老婆；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아내","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30196","senseId":"1","lemma":"아내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친정","meaning":"娘家","explanation":"친정：娘家","readings":[{"term":"친정","audio":"/audio/b210370fa8004fa28b42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28126","senseId":"1","lemma":"친정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나들이를","meaning":"串门，出行，出游","explanation":"나들이：串门，出行，出游；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나들이","audio":"/audio/8447c0adbd14f9de1a54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16298","senseId":"1","lemma":"나들이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔어요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"89180","definition":"“너(你)”后面加助词“가(表示动作主体)”时的形态。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"3611acca94af861e","term":"아내","zh":"妻子，爱人，老婆","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3","entryId":"30196","definition":"结婚而成为男子的配偶的女人。","pronunciation":["아내"]},{"id":"b210370fa8004fa2","term":"친정","zh":"娘家","audio":"/audio/b210370fa8004fa28b42.mp3","entryId":"28126","definition":"已婚女子原本生活着的、其家人所住的家。","pronunciation":["친정"]},{"id":"8447c0adbd14f9de","term":"나들이","zh":"串门，出行，出游","audio":"/audio/8447c0adbd14f9de1a54.mp3","entryId":"16298","definition":"暂时去一下离家不远的地方。","pronunciation":["나드리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ebc78d80fea9cb59d6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16298","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6954,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看您是独自来的，应该是您的妻子去哪儿了啊？","是的，我妻子去娘家玩了。","那个手表长什么样呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看您是独自来的，应该是您的妻子去哪儿了啊？","是的，我妻子去娘家玩了。","那个手表长什么样呢？"],"answer":1}]}
